    Comic Neue (Regular, Bold): Copyright 2014 The Comic Neue Project Authors
    Inter (variable; the default instance is Regular): Copyright 2016 The Inter
      Project Authors
    Silkscreen (Regular): Copyright 2001 The Silkscreen Project Authors
    Archivo Black (Regular): Copyright 2017 The Archivo Black Project Authors

  Each line is the copyright the font itself states; its licence file repeats
